comment.body:
Use the same class name multiple times to increase CSS specificity.

To override the existing scroll lock rule with `!important` flag. This should fix the issue.

```css
/* Existing scroll lock rule on website: Specificity (0, 1, 1) */
body.merlin-sale-popup-open { overflow: hidden !important }

 /* New rule: Specificity (0, 2, 1) */
body.merlin-sale-popup-open.merlin-sale-popup-open { overflow: initial !important }
```
<details><summary>Screenshot</summary>
<img width="300" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bd9a5d6a-c3ad-4ce5-a216-8909b5a41d5f" />
</details>

