comment.body:
It looks like that when popup is displayed then scroll is blocked.
So it will be impossible to scroll when `Cookie Notices filter` is disabled.
And website is greyed out for a moment, so also added `.home-welcome-modal + .modal-backdrop`.
```suggestion
infopraca.pl#$#.home-welcome-modal { display: none !important; }
infopraca.pl#$#.home-welcome-modal-backdrop { display: none !important; }
infopraca.pl#$#.home-welcome-modal + .modal-backdrop { display: none !important; }
infopraca.pl#$#body[style^="overflow:"] { overflow: auto !important; padding-right: 0 !important; }
```

